rides the\n        # environment variable 'no_proxy'\n        monkeypatch.setenv(\"http_proxy\", \"http://proxy.example.com:3128/\")\n        no_proxy = \"192.168.1.1,requests.com\"\n        assert get_environ_proxies(url, no_proxy=no_proxy) != {}", "calls": [], "called_by": [], "confidence": 0.92, "purpose": "Ensures that IP addresses are correctly matches with ranges"}
